    <string name="appliance_display_engine_label">On-screen interface</string>
    <string name="appliance_display_engine_help">Which of the two interfaces runs on the device\'s screen. The new one (Qt) draws straight on the screen, with no browser: it uses less power and stays smooth even on 4K screens. Music keeps playing when you switch.</string>
